WEBVTT

00:00:00.104 --> 00:00:05.968
Reviewing a leave request

00:00:06.018 --> 00:00:09.262
Open HR and Staff, then Leave.

00:00:13.629 --> 00:00:19.487
Find the pending request. It shows the leave type, the dates and the reason.

00:00:19.951 --> 00:00:23.765
Approve or reject it, and add remarks if you like.

00:00:37.142 --> 00:00:41.750
When a request is approved, the leave balance updates automatically.

00:00:42.718 --> 00:00:47.384
Leave reviewed
